4. Configure Router R0
Enter these commands:
enable
configure terminal
hostname R0
interface fastethernet0/1
ip address 198.123.1.1 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
exit
interface serial2/0
ip address 198.123.2.1 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
exit


5. Configure Router R1
enable
configure terminal
hostname R1
interface fastethernet0/1
ip address 198.123.3.1 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
exit
interface serial2/0
ip address 198.123.2.2 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
exit


Configure the router for BGP protocol.
R0> en
R0# conf t
R0 (config) # router bgp 100
                     # network 198.123.1.0
                     # network 198.123.2.0
                     # neighbor 198.123.2.2 remote-as 200
                     # neighbor 198.123.3.2 remote-as 200
R1> en
R1# conf t
R1 (config) # router bgp 200
                     # network 198.123.3.0
                     # network 198.123.2.0
                     # neighbor 198.123.2.1 remote-as 100
                     # neighbor 198.123.1.2 remote-as 100


